{"21":[{"k":"p","t":"6-3-2-1 High Score Initialization"},{"k":"p","t":"a. Select \u201cHIGH SCORE INITIALIZE\u201d on the GAME OPTIONS screen and press the start button. The screen will change to the HIGH SCORE INITIALIZE screen."},{"k":"p","t":"b. Move the Control Arm up or down to select the required item."},{"k":"p","t":"c. The high score is initialized (reset) by pressing the start button, and the screen returns to the GAME OPTIONS screen."},{"k":"p","t":"d. If \u201cNO is selected and the start button pressed, nothing is reset and the screen returns to the GAME OPTIONS screen."},{"k":"p","t":"( HI SCORE INITIALIZE"},{"k":"p","t":"NO . Initialization not performed."},{"k":"tr","t":"YES   (STD)   vacessssesteseseseseseeey . Only the standard course hi score is reset."},{"k":"tr","t":"YES   (EXP)   \u2014\u2014ssasissszexseniueneaccenee . Only the expert course hi score is reset."},{"k":"tr","t":"YES   (BOTH):   \u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014atarrarscssuaneacvansanaed . The hi score for both courses are reset."},{"k":"p","t":"CONTROL:CHOOSE START;ENTER Ne 7"},{"k":"p","t":"Page PB"}],"23":[{"k":"p","t":"6-3-3-1 Switch Test"},{"k":"p","t":"a. Select \u201cSWITCH TEST\u201d on the menu screen and press the start button. The following screen is displayed."},{"k":"p","t":"b. Operate the accelerator lever and start button together to return to menu screen"},{"k":"p","t":"Va VO TEST"},{"k":"p","t":"TEST SW ON COIN SW OFF SERVICE SW OFF START BUTTON OFF"},{"k":"tr","t":"ACCELLEVER   0000   0000"},{"k":"tr","t":"SWING   0000   0000"},{"k":"tr","t":"HANDLE POLE   0000   0000"},{"k":"p","t":"Ne START+LEVER:EXIT ~"},{"k":"p","t":"CENTRE .l......... (f)"},{"k":"p","t":"J"},{"k":"p","t":"(9) Test Switch:"},{"k":"p","t":"Coin Switch:"},{"k":"p","t":"Service Switch"},{"k":"p","t":"Start button"},{"k":"p","t":"Accelerator Lever"},{"k":"p","t":"Ship Swing"},{"k":"p","t":"Handle Pole \u201cON\u201d during test mode."},{"k":"p","t":"\u2018OFF\u2019 will change to \u2018ON\u2019 when the coins to the correct game value have been inserted through the Cashflow acceptor or the coin switch is operated (S18 mech)."},{"k":"p","t":"\u2018OFF\u2019 will change to \u2018ON\u2019 each time the service switch is pressed."},{"k":"p","t":"\u2018OFF\u2019 will change to \u2018ON\u2019 each time the start button is pressed. The button lamp will light each time the button is pressed."},{"k":"p","t":"\u2018FREE\u2019 will change to \u2018OK\u2019 each time the lever is operated fully."},{"k":"p","t":"\u2018CENTER\u2019 is displayed when in the central stand by position. \u2018RIGHT\u2019 and \u2018OK\u2019 is displayed when swung fully to the right. \u2018LEFT\u2019 and \u2018OK\u2019 is displayed when swung fully to the left."},{"k":"p","t":"\u2018UP OK\u2019 is displayed when the control arm is fully raised, \u201cDOWN OK\u2019 is displayed when the control arm is fully lowered."},{"k":"note","t":"NOTE: If \u2018OK\u2019 does not appear when the ride is swung to its extreme travel, re-initialize the game as described in section 7"},{"k":"p","t":"Page PB"}],"38":[{"k":"li","t":"9. PARTS"},{"k":"p","t":"Header Assy"},{"k":"p","t":"\u00a3 yi"},{"k":"p","t":"ITEM DESCRIPTION PART No"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   HEADER CABINET   37100110"},{"k":"tr","t":"2   LOUDSPEAKER GRILLE   46000083"},{"k":"tr","t":"4   HEADER ACRYLIC   30000234"},{"k":"tr","t":"=   ACRYLIC RETAINING BRACKET   46000084"},{"k":"tr","t":"Et   FLOURESCENT TUBE 18\" 15W   64500009"},{"k":"tr","t":"\u20143   |LOUDSPEAKER 5%\" FULL RANGE   62000065"},{"k":"tr","t":"E4   | STARTER 240v 4-80W UNIVERSAL   63000000"},{"k":"tr","t":"\u20145   |STARTER HOLDER   64800001"},{"k":"p","t":"M6x16 HEX HEAD SET SCREW - BZP 26500311"},{"k":"tr","t":"BI   M6 SPRING WASHER - BZP   28000028"},{"k":"p","t":"M6 FLAT WASHER - BZP 28000166"},{"k":"p","t":"M4x16 PZ PAN HEAD - BLACK 26300294"},{"k":"tr","t":"B2   |M4 SPRING WASHER - BLACK   28000127"},{"k":"p","t":"M4 FLAT WASHER - BLACK 28000132"},{"k":"tr","t":"B3   _|M5x20 SECURITY